// The CLI version of Sherpa.app (AGENTS.md lists every place that carries it). The Sherpa target
// writes it to CFBundleShortVersionString and CFBundleVersion, and sherpa-relay --version reads it
// from there. scripts/check-all.sh fails when the built app's version differs from the CLI's.
MARKETING_VERSION = 0.8.6
CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION = $(MARKETING_VERSION)
